{
 "case": "N07-C05-NEG",
 "says": "Four concerns in the repository memory each have a flaw that must leave state unresolved rather than ranked. A page-size choice states reliance on a record this reader cannot reach: its entry is unresolved with basis_target_missing and the comparison counts the unreachable record. A cache choice is replaced whole by two later choices: the replaced entry and both successors are unresolved with competing_successors, and neither the newer nor the older successor wins. A vacuum choice is both adopted and withdrawn by events stating the same instant: its entry is unresolved with lifecycle_contradiction. Two checkpoint choices written in another checkout, each already carrying its record id, arrive when Alice commits the pulled docs/decisions files as the memory source's next revision; each states reliance on the other, so both entries are unresolved with basis_cycle. In none of the four does a timestamp, an order or a ranking select a current entry.",
